<!--
  Prayer-time status bar icon: the same pointed arch as the app mark, standing
  on its threshold, with a point of light above it. Android masks a status bar
  icon to a silhouette, so this is flat white and reads by shape alone - which
  is the whole reason the prayer notification does not simply reuse the app
  icon. A person glancing at a crowded status bar should be able to tell a
  prayer from a reminder without opening the shade.
-->
